Package: dashboard
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Dahlia Linux <https://github.com/Fabiy99/dahlia-linux>
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Depends: python3 (>= 3.11), python3-fastapi, python3-uvicorn, python3-websockets, nginx, qrencode, adduser, systemd, agent (= @VERSION@),
 cage, cog, libgl1-mesa-dri, fonts-dejavu-core
Description: Dahlia Linux web dashboard
 Web UI on https://<server>/ for disks, jobs, updates and the system.
 The backend runs as the unprivileged user ui on 127.0.0.1:8080
 behind nginx and reaches root actions only through agent. The
 first visit opens a setup wizard protected by a one-time code shown on
 the console. terminal provides the terminal page: "su -l <user>"
 in a pseudo-terminal, so the Linux password is asked there.
 screen shows the start screen on a monitor attached to the server
 (cage and cog on tty1, loopback only).
